      <a class="sp-outbtn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/gsn-farma" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 11-.02 5 2.5 2.5 0 01.02-5zM3 9.5h4V21H3V9.5zm6.5 0h3.8v1.6h.06c.53-1 1.84-2 3.8-2 4.06 0 4.84 2.67 4.84 6.15V21h-4v-5.1c0-1.22-.02-2.78-1.7-2.78-1.7 0-1.96 1.33-1.96 2.7V21h-4V9.5z"></path></svg> LinkedIn</a>
